575
00:45:56.297 --> 00:45:57.924
See ya!

576
00:45:59.342 --> 00:46:01.678
Are you all ready
for this, junior astronauts?

577
00:46:01.720 --> 00:46:03.888
- Yeah!
- -That's what I like to hear!

578
00:46:03.930 --> 00:46:06.599
Okay, so, just to let
you know, Mums and Dads,

579
00:46:06.641 --> 00:46:09.853
